  "logline": "When the container ship Meridian Star vanishes from tracking for eleven days and reappears with her crew silent and one hold welded shut, maritime investigator Sarah Venn boards her in Rotterdam — and finds the cargo manifest lists forty containers that were loaded in three different centuries.",
